# Google Drive API Configuration
# To enable Google Drive storage, you need to set up Google Cloud Console credentials

# Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID
# Get this from: Google Cloud Console > APIs & Services > Credentials
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id_here

# Google Drive API Key  
# Get this from: Google Cloud Console > APIs & Services > Credentials
VITE_GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a new project or select existing one
# 3. Enable Google Drive API
# 4. Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID credentials
# 5. Create API Key credentials
# 6. Add your domain to authorized JavaScript origins (e.g., http://localhost:5173)
# 7. Copy the values above and rename this file to .env
